{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420690/extras/b46dc5fc63a9a064bb121679ccb8517b.poster.avif?t=1769170059\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420690/extras/b46dc5fc63a9a064bb121679ccb8517b.webm?t=1769170059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420690/extras/b46dc5fc63a9a064bb121679ccb8517b.mp4?t=1769170059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 overpowered guns  right from the beginning. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Big hordes of ferocious beasts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of blood and gore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless game world without loading screens.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old School Death Metal music: &quot;GUTS - Decay&quot; provided by Vargheist Records.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE WORLD</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric forest, ancient ruins, gothic cathedrals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear campaign in a seamless game world without loading screens, not divided into levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructible trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game completion takes 2-4 hours depending on the difficulty selected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420690/extras/870ab67839dd6b0b4ebec880cc734fe6.poster.avif?t=1769170059\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420690/extras/870ab67839dd6b0b4ebec880cc734fe6.webm?t=1769170059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420690/extras/870ab67839dd6b0b4ebec880cc734fe6.mp4?t=1769170059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>8 OVERPOWERED GUNS RIGHT FROM THE BEGINNING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>In this game you can aim, which gives different buffs to the guns.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>P90</strong> - regular, precise autogun that transforms into a 10,000 RPM BEAST when aiming!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grenade Launcher</strong> -\u00a0shoots big, spiky projectiles that damage enemies on physical hit and explode after.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MP5</strong> - charges up when you hit enemies, increasing fire rate, damage and accuracy. Every hit also adds 3 ammo to the clip!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Machine Gun</strong> - very high damage output at the cost of your speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winchester</strong> - shoots explosive projectiles, explosion is bigger if you shoot heads!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shotgun</strong> - shoots fast, and even faster when Aiming!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Shotgun</strong> - completely overpowered gun with penetrative bullets, but slow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pistol -</strong> burst firing, pretty powerful with high damage despite having infinite ammo and serving as a backup weapon.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SLAM AWAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>powerful melee attack ability that deals enormous damage in a big area</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killing enemies charges up your Slam Away ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you kill anyone with Slam Away, you refill all your guns clips.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies who die from Slam Away drop more health/armor/ammo pickups.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420690/extras/4268af13f33e659ada15c373ba5f51b9.poster.avif?t=1769170059\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420690/extras/4268af13f33e659ada15c373ba5f51b9.webm?t=1769170059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420690/extras/4268af13f33e659ada15c373ba5f51b9.mp4?t=1769170059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ENEMIES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Range attacking enemies will hide from you while reloading their attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melee enemies will move in a strafing manner and will try to surround you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many enemies have combined behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many enemies will change their behavior depending on damage received. If you shoot hands off some enemies, they will become range attacking only, others will bite you with their teeth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some enemies have their quirks: for example, Hydra, with each head lost, becomes faster, or Goblin with a shield will be very fast and angry if you destroy his shield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies varying from very fast, with unpredictable behavior, to slow and tanky.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most enemies can have armor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overall, there are 21 enemy types + 11 mini bosses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GORE SYSTEM</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed dismemberment allows you to cut off enemies limbs: hands, forearms, upper arms, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physically simulated interactive gore can be pushed around by shooting or explosions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gore parts and blood splatters are eternal (not disappearing)! But to not fry your PCs, there's a limit to the gore/blood amount. Same with dead enemies bodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420690/extras/7d0c322f81b3e2a35bc379ce237fedc7.poster.avif?t=1769170059\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420690/extras/7d0c322f81b3e2a35bc379ce237fedc7.webm?t=1769170059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420690/extras/7d0c322f81b3e2a35bc379ce237fedc7.mp4?t=1769170059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PLAYER MOVEMENT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprint</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Directional double jump - while in the air, you can jump not up, but to the side. Good for jumping over enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bunny hop - gain speed by jumping fast without stopping. Combine with Sprint to gain even more speed!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If not moving, you jump higher.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DIFFICULTY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game created with 100% &quot;Very Challenging&quot; preset difficulty in mind. It's very hard and requires constant movement, strategic use of resources, and good positioning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game difficulty scales from very challenging to super easy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can manually set difficulty values lower than the lowest preset, reducing incoming damage down to 5% and enemy speed down to 50%.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of checkpoints - if you die, you don't lose more than 5 minutes of your time!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>TUTORIALS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-gameplay-interruptive tutorials are displayed for each gun and for each player ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disappear once you complete them. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always available from the pause menu.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game made by one person - may contain issues. Please report if you encountered any.</h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You've beat it!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3420690/f5997cbb972f21f54724cef523183669fa3f92b6.jpg"},{"name":"Tough guy!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3420690/f5997cbb972f21f54724cef523183669fa3f92b6.jpg"},{"name":"Furry beast shaved!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3420690/f5997cbb972f21f54724cef523183669fa3f92b6.jpg"},{"name":"Spiky beast smashed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3420690/f5997cbb972f21f54724cef523183669fa3f92b6.jpg"},{"name":"Cold beast warmed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3420690/f5997cbb972f21f54724cef523183669fa3f92b6.jpg"},{"name":"Stinky beast washed!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3420690/f5997cbb972f21f54724cef523183669fa3f92b6.jpg"},{"name":"That was big stinky one!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3420690/f5997cbb972f21f54724cef523183669fa3f92b6.jpg"},{"name":"Mouthless demolished!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3420690/f5997cbb972f21f54724cef523183669fa3f92b6.jpg"},{"name":"Big and frosty!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3420690/f5997cbb972f21f54724cef523183669fa3f92b6.jpg"},{"name":"Why he is so fast?!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3420690/f5997cbb972f21f54724cef523183669fa3f92b6.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3420690?t=1769170059","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3420690?t=1769170059","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420690/c28a1b185efc208a7305f5fdef955a3d674dff66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769170059","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420690/c28a1b185efc208a7305f5fdef955a3d674dff66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769170059","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"